<title>NEW ZEALAND: Nuplex final div strike price NZ$5.70.</title>
<headline>Nuplex final div strike price NZ$5.70.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nuplex Industries on Thursday said the strike price for its final dividend had been set at NZ$5.69731.</p>
